<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Grupo Bachoco to launch IPO this year.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Grupo Bachoco to launch IPO this year.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS DE MORENO, Mexico 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Bachoco, the leading producer of eggs and chicken in Mexico, on Wednesday said it will soon launch an initial public offering on the Mexican stock exchange and outside Mexico.</p>
<p>&quot;I cannot say exactly when we will do it, since we want to be flexible, but I can assure you that it will be in 1997,&quot; the director general of the company, Arquimides Celis, told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be a global offering&quot;, he said, without giving details.</p>
<p>((-- Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara newsroom, +523 817-0397))</p>
